{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20022770,"chapterID":15000203,"chapterNumber":"II-3","sectionNumber":"23-424","title":"Height and setback requirements for qualifying residential sites","officialText":"","previewText":"R1 R2 R3 R4 R5\n\nIn the districts indicated, for qualifying residential sites, the height and setback modifications set forth in this Section shall apply.\n\nThe maximum base height and maximum building height shall be as set forth in the following table. At a height not higher than the maximum base height, a setback shall be provided in accordance with Section 23-423.\n\nMAXIMUM BASE HEIGHT AND MAXIMUM BUILDING HEIGHTS F","blocks":[{"id":"zr-22770-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p>R1 R2 R3 R4 R5</p>","plainText":"R1 R2 R3 R4 R5"},{"id":"zr-22770-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p>In the districts indicated, for <strong><em>qualifying residential sites</em></strong>, the height and setback modifications set forth in this Section shall apply.&nbsp;</p>","plainText":"In the districts indicated, for qualifying residential sites, the height and setback modifications set forth in this Section shall apply."},{"id":"zr-22770-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<p>The maximum base height and maximum <strong><em>building</em></strong> height shall be as set forth in the following table. At a height not higher than the maximum base height, a setback shall be provided in accordance with Section 23-423.</p>","plainText":"The maximum base height and maximum building height shall be as set forth in the following table. At a height not higher than the maximum base height, a setback shall be provided in accordance with Section 23-423."},{"id":"zr-22770-block-004","kind":"html","html":"<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"color:black\">MAXIMUM BASE HEIGHT AND MAXIMUM <strong><em>BUILDING</em></strong> HEIGHTS FOR <strong><em>QUALIFYING RESIDENTIAL SITES